{"id":"jalapao","title":"Jalapão","who":"Classic route · the Cerrado's desert by 4x4","when":"May to October","vehicle":"4x4 (or guided), 4–7 days","kind":"4x4","color":"#ea580c","summary":"A loop from Palmas into the empty heart of Tocantins: orange dunes under a table mountain, spring-fed \"fervedouros\" where the water pushes you up so you can't sink, waterfalls, golden-grass crafts in quilombola villages. Over 165 km of sand and stone with no phone signal; carry fuel and spares. The dunes are visited only with a guide, the best-known fervedouros are on private land with their own fee, and Mateiros charges a visitor fee since May 2026.","sources":[{"label":"Pontos pra Voar: new Jalapão visitor fee from 1 May 2026","url":"https://pontospravoar.com/jalapao-tera-nova-taxa-para-visitantes-a-partir-de-1o-de-maio/"},{"label":"Mala de Aventuras: roteiro Jalapão em 4, 5 ou 7 dias","url":"https://maladeaventuras.com/roteiro-jalapao"},{"label":"Melhores Destinos: como se locomover no Jalapão","url":"https://guia.melhoresdestinos.com.br/como-se-locomover-no-jalapao.html"}],"approximate":"The usual circuit; the tracks are sand and the line is a guide only.","km":625,"bbox":[-48.3341,-10.7454,-46.4174,-10.1006],"stops":[{"name":"Palmas","place":"Palmas, Tocantins","at":[-10.1838,-48.3336],"text":"Brazil's newest state capital, last big shop and fuel.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/Palmas-TO.jpg/500px-Palmas-TO.jpg","page":"Palmas, Tocantins","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Palmas-TO.jpg","credit":"Compiled by Heitor Carvalho Jorge","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"Ponte Alta","place":"Ponte Alta do Tocantins","at":[-10.7455,-47.5374],"text":"The \"gateway of Jalapão\": Lagoa do Japonês and the Pedra Furada arch.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/Ponte_Alta_do_Tocantins_centro.jpg/500px-Ponte_Alta_do_Tocantins_centro.jpg","page":"Ponte Alta do Tocantins","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ponte_Alta_do_Tocantins_centro.jpg","credit":"Victor Lopes","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"Mateiros","place":"Mateiros, Tocantins","at":[-10.5462,-46.4174],"text":"The hardest stretch, sand and stones over the Serra da Muriçoca, to the central village.","source":{"label":"Mala de Aventuras","url":"https://maladeaventuras.com/roteiro-jalapao"}},{"name":"The dunes","place":"Dunas do Jalapão","at":[-10.4467,-46.6603],"text":"Orange dunes at the foot of the Serra do Espírito Santo, best at sunset.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/91/Dunas_do_Jalap%C3%A3o%2C_em_Mateiros.jpg/500px-Dunas_do_Jalap%C3%A3o%2C_em_Mateiros.jpg","page":"Jalapão State Park","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dunas_do_Jalap%C3%A3o%2C_em_Mateiros.jpg","credit":"aduarteweb","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0"}},{"name":"São Félix","place":"São Félix do Tocantins","at":[-10.1615,-46.6618],"text":"The Buritizinho and Bela Vista fervedouros: floating in a spring."},{"name":"Back to Palmas","place":"Palmas, Tocantins","at":[-10.1838,-48.3336],"text":"Back to tarmac and the city."}],"legs":[{"by":"ride","km":156,"line":[[-10.1844,-48.3341],[-10.2242,-48.3336],[-10.2241,-48.3115],[-10.3342,-48.2987],[-10.3055,-48.195],[-10.3154,-48.1518],[-10.2923,-48.1399],[-10.2618,-48.0374],[-10.2236,-47.9947],[-10.2765,-47.8144],[-10.3293,-47.7914],[-10.3738,-47.742],[-10.4317,-47.7331],[-10.4644,-47.7082],[-10.5719,-47.7371],[-10.6158,-47.6585],[-10.618,-47.6256],[-10.6575,-47.6044],[-10.6794,-47.5579],[-10.7454,-47.537]]},{"by":"ride","km":160,"line":[[-10.7454,-47.537],[-10.64,-47.4214],[-10.638,-47.2918],[-10.5661,-47.2235],[-10.4507,-47.1736],[-10.4092,-47.0963],[-10.4992,-46.9819],[-10.5169,-46.8764],[-10.5868,-46.8281],[-10.5547,-46.7627],[-10.5803,-46.7379],[-10.6175,-46.6429],[-10.5633,-46.4564],[-10.5649,-46.418],[-10.5466,-46.4175]]},{"by":"ride","km":29,"line":[[-10.5462,-46.4174],[-10.4467,-46.6603]]},{"by":"ride","km":41,"lin